| F36:AK36 | 32 | `=F35/10` | F35 | intermediate | 0.1 | $`\frac{\mathrm{F35}}{10}`$ |
| D38:D58 | 21 | `=C38+273.15` | C38 | intermediate | 273.15 |  |
